   "subject": "Re: How to reduce overlap between branches of an unrooted tree.",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">ggtree</code> only implement <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">equal-angle</code> algorithm and do have this problem.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">ape</code> implemented more complex algorithm and can use more space.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">You can use <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">ape</code>‘s node position in <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">ggtree</code>.</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\">plot(x, type=<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;unrooted&#39;</span>)\r\n\r\np = ggtree(x, layout=<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;unrooted&#39;</span>)\r\nxx = get(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;last_plot.phylo&quot;</span>, envir=.PlotPhyloEnv)\r\np$data$y = xx$yy\r\np$data$x = xx$xx\r\n\r\np\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj48ZGl2PjxkaXY+YGdndHJlZWAgb25seSBpbXBsZW1lbnQgYGVxdWFsLWFuZ2xlYCBhbGdv\r\ncml0aG0gYW5kIGRvIGhhdmUgdGhpcyBwcm9ibGVtLjxicj48YnI+PC9kaXY+YGFwZWAgaW1wbGVt\r\nZW50ZWQgbW9yZSBjb21wbGV4IGFsZ29yaXRobSBhbmQgY2FuIHVzZSBtb3JlIHNwYWNlLjxicj48\r\nYnI+PC9kaXY+WW91IGNhbiB1c2UgYGFwZWAncyBub2RlIHBvc2l0aW9uIGluIGBnZ3RyZWVgLjxi\r\ncj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5gYGByPGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+cGxvdCh4LCB0eXBlPSd1bnJvb3Rl\r\nZCcpPGJyPjxicj5wID0gZ2d0cmVlKHgsIGxheW91dD0ndW5yb290ZWQnKTxicj54eCA9IGdldCgi\r\nbGFzdF9wbG90LnBoeWxvIiwgZW52aXI9LlBsb3RQaHlsb0Vudik8YnI+cCRkYXRhJHkgPSB4eCR5\r\neTxicj5wJGRhdGEkeCA9IHh4JHh4PGJyPjxicj48L2Rpdj5wPGJyPmBgYDxicj4=\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
